<title>FRANCE: CYCLING-LEADING ETOILE DE BESSEGES RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-LEADING ETOILE DE BESSEGES RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the fifth and</p>
<p>last stage of the Etoile de Besseges cycle race over 142 kms</p>
<p>from Moliere-sur-Ceze on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Jan Svorada (Czech Republic) Mapei three hours 21.42 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Elio Aggiano (Italy) Refin	    2 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Enrico Cassani (Italy) Polti			   11 secs</p>
<p> 4. Gerard Rue (France) Gan				same time</p>
<p> 5. Peter Farazijn (Belgium) Lotto		     same time</p>
<p> 6. Frederic Bessy (France) Casino		     same time</p>
<p> 7. Jann Kirsipuu (Estonia) Casino			 25</p>
<p> 8. Gabriele Balducci (Italy) Refin		    same time</p>
<p> 9. Jo Planckaert (Belgium) Lotto			same time</p>
<p> 10. Bruno Boscardin (Italy) Festina		   same time</p>
<p>Final overall standings:</p>
<p>1. Patrice Halgand (France) Festina 16 hours 26.42 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Zbigniew Spruch (Poland) Mapei	5 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Boscardin						 6 secs</p>
<p> 4. Eros Poli (Italy) Gan				  same time</p>
<p> 5. Rodolfo Massi (Italy) Casino		     10</p>
<p> 6. Laurent Roux (France) TVM			  12</p>
<p> 7. Svorada						1:01</p>
<p> 8. Aggiano						1:34</p>
<p> 9. Rue						    1:48</p>
<p> 10. Farazijn						  same time</p>
